  "atomic_questions": [
    "Are the production rates in the table (e.g., Workshop A produces 10 units/hour of Component 1) the same for every workshop-component pair as listed?",
    "Is the time a workshop spends on a component simply the number of units of that component divided by that workshop's rate for it?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response contains two distinct clarification requests joined by 'and': one confirming the validity of the listed rates for all pairs, and another confirming the calculation method for time. A user could confirm the rates are correct but dispute the time calculation formula, meaning they are semantically independent."
}

